        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Tiendesitas, Frontera Verde, Ortigas Center, Pasig, Mandaluyong, Quezon City, Metro Manila, Philippines\n- Topics: shopping complexes, business districts, development projects\n\nFacts:\n- Ortigas Center is a financial and central business district at the boundaries of Pasig, Mandaluyong, and Quezon City in the Philippines.\n- Ortigas Center covers more than 100 hectares and is Metro Manila's second most important business district after the Makati CBD.\n- Tiendesitas is a shopping complex located along C-5 Road at the corner of Eulogio Rodriguez Jr.\n- Tiendesitas was constructed at a cost of P200 million.\n- Tiendesitas is part of Frontera Verde, an interim 18.5-hectare development project in Ortigas Center.",
